{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1028217-i-m-running-a-mixed-chronicles-of-darkness-game-at-the-end-of-month-and-need-help","id":1028217,"title":"I'm running a mixed Chronicles of Darkness game at the end of month and need help.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-07T11:50:46-08:00","id":1028217,"title":"I'm running a mixed Chronicles of Darkness game at the end of month and need help.","content":"First, it seems they changed the setting a bit. The Free Council seems to be separate now from the others. I'm not understanding this. Also, did they take out reference to Atlantis? I've only skimmed the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas","name":"Blue Thomas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T11:53:18-08:00","id":1028218,"title":"","content":"You could definitely get the answers you want by reading it more thoroughly.<br /> <br /> Short answers: FC: Only as separate as it ever was. Atlantis: Reference to it is in one of the Appendix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T12:34:05-08:00","id":1028233,"title":"","content":"The Free Council has always been its own Order separate from but allied with the Diamond. The Pentacle only really exists in terms of being opposed to the Seers of the Throne; it's more accurate to have say there's the Diamond Orders and then the FC.<br /> <br /> Atlantis is now treated as both a metaphor and an infinite number of timelines and worlds wiped from existence by the Fall, and forms the background mythology of the Diamond.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T12:39:05-08:00","id":1028235,"title":"","content":"Free Council is still part of Pentacle - alliance against Seers of Throne - but they are different <i>culture</i> from four older Orders. Diamond is all about recreating utopia - called Atlantis by the forefathers - and creating various 'perfect societies' on Earth, using scraps of Time Before they can uncover. ( What exactly was/should be this Atlantis, is based on particular Diamond Order dogma. ) 2E Free Council is all about real world occult practices and tradition, meld in the direct democratic government - everyone that Diamond did not liked for millenia ( or those that did not wanted to join Diamond ) in their ranks, called Nameless. Free Council was created after the great upheaval of those 'Orderless' mages in XIX called Nameless War.<br /> <br /> If you know <b>Mage: The Ascension,</b> 2E Free Council were very much equated to Council of Nine from older game setting. And Diamond is still much a like great secret societies/cults in their game play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-07-2017, 04:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T12:42:41-08:00","id":1028237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1028217-i-m-running-a-mixed-chronicles-of-darkness-game-at-the-end-of-month-and-need-help?p=1028235#post1028235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Free Council is still part of Pentacle - alliance against Seers of Throne - but they are different <i>culture</i> from four older Orders. Diamond is all about recreating utopia - called Atlantis by the forefathers - and creating various 'perfect societies' on Earth, using scraps of Time Before they can uncover. ( What exactly was/should be this Atlantis, is based on particular Diamond Order dogma. ) 2E Free Council is all about real world occult practices and tradition, meld in the direct democratic government - everyone that Diamond did not liked for millenia ( or those that did not wanted to join Diamond ) in their ranks, called Nameless.<br /> <br /> If you know <b>Mage: The Ascension,</b> 2E Free Council were very much equated to Council of Nine from older game setting. And Diamond is still much a like great secret societies/cults in their game play.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. That clears it up some.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas","name":"Blue Thomas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}